sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser
    participant Ctrl as Check your answers POST<br/>(controller-post.js)
    participant Auth as Auth Controller<br/>(auth/controller.js)
    participant Yar as Yar Session
    participant DefraID as Defra ID Provider<br/>(External OIDC)

    Browser->>Ctrl: POST /request-to-use/check-your-answers
    Ctrl->>Yar: get submitReauth (not verified)
    Ctrl->>Yar: set submitReauth = pending, redirectTo = /request-to-use/check-your-answers
    Ctrl-->>Browser: 303 to /auth/sign-in?prompt=none

    Browser->>Auth: GET /auth/sign-in?prompt=none
    Auth->>Yar: set oauth_state
    Auth-->>Browser: 302 to authorization_endpoint (prompt=none)
    Browser->>DefraID: GET authorization_endpoint

    alt "Still signed in to Defra ID"
        DefraID-->>Browser: 302 to /login/return?code&state
        Browser->>Auth: GET /login/return
        Auth->>Yar: submitReauth = verified
        Auth-->>Browser: 302 to redirectTo (check your answers)
    else "Signed out of Defra ID elsewhere"
        DefraID-->>Browser: 302 to /login/return?error=interaction_required&state
        Browser->>Auth: GET /login/return
        Auth->>Yar: verify state, clear oauth_state (submitReauth stays pending)
        Auth-->>Browser: 302 to /auth/sign-in
        Note over Browser,DefraID: Normal sign-in, then /login/return as above
    end

    Browser->>Ctrl: POST /request-to-use/check-your-answers
    Ctrl->>Yar: get + clear submitReauth (verified)
    Ctrl-->>Browser: 303 to /request-to-use/confirmation
